stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Loading
    Loading --> NotStarted: start_time > now
    Loading --> Closed: end_time < now
    Loading --> Forbidden: not enrolled / not assigned
    Loading --> Active: window open
    Active --> Editing: render question N
    Editing --> Autosaving: every 15 s
    Autosaving --> Editing
    Editing --> Editing: change question
    Editing --> Submitting: click Submit
    Submitting --> Submitted: 201 from API
    Submitting --> Editing: 4xx error
    Submitted --> [*]
